# Multi-CC coordination — per-session runtime state (Plan §4.1)
# .claude/sessions/ holds per-session scratchpads (consent flags, plan,
# last-review.json). Always runtime-only.
.claude/sessions/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
# .claude/active-plan.md is the Plan Manifest (CLAUDE.md "Delete when done").
# Symlinked to per-session sessions/<sid>/plan.md once SessionStart hook ships.
.claude/active-plan.md

# Multi-CC coordination — runtime state under .claude/coordination/
# Nothing under .claude/ is tracked: the whole directory is ignored at the end
# of this file (decisions/, DEPLOY_RULES.md and TEAM_NORMS.md are author-local
# too). The runtime-only entries stay listed explicitly. Some worktree wiring uses
# symlinks to canonical runtime paths, so keep both `path` and `path/` forms
# ignored where the target may appear as either a symlink or a real directory.
.claude/coordination/active.jsonl
.claude/coordination/heartbeat
.claude/coordination/heartbeat/
.claude/coordination/active-work
.claude/coordination/active-work/
.claude/coordination/broadcasts
.claude/coordination/broadcasts/
